From: Valentin Caron <valentin.caron@foss.st.com>
Date: Wed, 5 Feb 2025 17:29:41 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 516/913] scmi-server: disable
 CFG_SCPFW_MOD_OPTEE_VOLTD_REGULATOR by default

Since version v2.14.0-rc0, SCP-firmware got a module optee_vold_regulator/
Make sure to disable it by default.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git 0b7600b9189ee3556db4aabc88870f9c6036fa97 scmi-server: disable CFG_SCPFW_MOD_OPTEE_VOLTD_REGULATOR by default]
Signed-off-by: Valentin Caron <valentin.caron@foss.st.com>
Change-Id: Id633324d890ece8a8d5e330b790218bccda506ed
---
 core/lib/scmi-server/conf.mk | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/core/lib/scmi-server/conf.mk b/core/lib/scmi-server/conf.mk
index 63f288a16..85fcab416 100644
--- a/core/lib/scmi-server/conf.mk
+++ b/core/lib/scmi-server/conf.mk
@@ -42,6 +42,7 @@ CFG_SCPFW_MOD_OPTEE_CONSOLE ?= y
 CFG_SCPFW_MOD_OPTEE_MBX ?= n
 CFG_SCPFW_MOD_OPTEE_RESET ?= n
 CFG_SCPFW_MOD_OPTEE_SMT ?= n
+CFG_SCPFW_MOD_OPTEE_VOLTD_REGULATOR ?= n
 CFG_SCPFW_MOD_POWER_DOMAIN ?= n
 CFG_SCPFW_MOD_PSU ?= n
 CFG_SCPFW_MOD_REG_SENSOR ?= n
